// BT-4070: test fixture — an actor proxy whose `doesNotUnderstand:args:`
// is a catch-all answering a marker, so the pure-conditional fallback
// send for a non-Boolean receiver is observable. (An actor, because the
// runtime consults `doesNotUnderstand:args:` overrides on the actor
// dispatch path.)

Actor subclass: Bt4070ProbeProxy

  doesNotUnderstand: _selector args: _arguments =>
    #bt4070Intercepted
